<title>SPAIN: FORECAST -Fecsa 96 net seen up 2.5 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST -Fecsa 96 net seen up 2.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish electricity firm Fuerzas Electricas de Cataluna SA (Fecsa). Simple averages of analysts forecasts. In billion of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>    Operating income	 238.0     235.56    245.51-231.75</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 15.78	15.39    17.00- 14.01</p>
<p>Contributors: AB Asesores, ABN-Amro, Ahorro Corporacion, Benito y Monjardin, Beta Capital, Credit Lyonnais, Ibersecurities.</p>
<p>Fecsa said it expects to release its results mid-February.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
</text>
